OL,3,CProgramme listings for TUE 25 NOV
OL,4,G2145FThe Essay: Watching from the Wings
OL,5,     GDuring his acting career, Michael
OL,6,     GGoldfarb spent a lot of time
OL,7,     Gwatching from the wings, waiting
OL,8,     Gto go on stage. In this episode
OL,9,     Ghe talks about Maxim Gorky's play
OL,10,     GSummerfolk.
OL,11,G2200FNight Tracks
OL,12,     GSara Mohr-Pietsch presents an
OL,13,     Gadventurous, immersive soundtrack
OL,14,     Gfor late-night listening, from
OL,15,     Gclassical to contemporary and
OL,16,     Geverything in between.
OL,17,G2330F'Round Midnight
OL,18,     GTrombonist and producer Rosie
OL,19,     GTurton has a second favourite
OL,20,     Galbum to share tonight for
